We go into the bedroom.
It is a small and cosy room.
There is a bed by the wall.
It is a big, white bed.
There is a blanket on the bed.
It is a warm blanket.
I touch the blanket.
It is very soft.
By the bed stands a small lamp.
The lamp is also white.
Nina looks at the bed and the lamp.
Nina nods.
"You can sleep well here," she says.
Yes, I think so.
